          "why": "יממה בשניות",
          "tex": "r = \\sqrt[3]{\\frac{4.1 \\times 10^{14} \\cdot 86400^2}{4\\pi^2}} \\approx 4.24 \\times 10^7\\,\\text{m}"
        }
      ],
      "finalAnswer": "$\\approx 4.24 \\times 10^7\\,\\text{m}$",
